<title>AUSTRALIA: Sons Gwalia appoints Lalor exec chairman.</title>
<headline>Sons Gwalia appoints Lalor exec chairman.</headline>
<dateline>PERTH 1997-04-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>Western Australia gold producer and explorer Sons of Gwalia Ltd said on Monday that managing director Peter Lalor had been appointed executive chairman following the retirement of chairman Jim Ainsworth.</p>
<p>The company, a second-tier producer, said U.K.-based Ainsworth would be retained as consultant for a maximum period of one year.</p>
<p>-- Sydney Newsroom 61-2 9373-1800</p>
</text>
